# Cloak and Dagger, Entwined: a land is not a nonland card, so a hand of nothing but lands and no creature to choose
# leaves nothing to exile. The default answer to an exile question is to take the first card on offer, so Bot2's hand
# staying at seven (it draws to eight and discards to hand size on turn 2) shows no land was taken. The positive control is the neighbouring
# scenario, where a nonland card is in the hand and is exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Cloak and Dagger, Entwined
Plains x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x7
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cloak and Dagger, Entwined.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Exile.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Cloak and Dagger, Entwined
